Placeholder pictures of Nudge Builder

The twelve pictures in this folder (building, interior, office, team, workshop,
product, food, fashion, tech, clinic, school, abstract) were drawn by the script
tools/make_placeholders.py of this module, from gradients and geometric shapes.
They are not photographs and contain no third party work.

